# Staging Supabase project settings -> Project Settings -> API
# Fill this in once the staging Supabase project exists, then save it as
# `.env.staging` (safe to commit, like .env.production -- these are public
# keys protected by RLS, not secrets). Used by `npm run cf:deploy:staging`
# to bake the staging Supabase URL into the build instead of production's.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
